      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i had a weird thing happen like an hour ago. my vision went all blurry in my left eye for like maybe 2 mins and my right hand felt kinda clumsy and awkward but it's totally gone now and i feel fine. probably just tired right? should i be worried or just wait and see if it happens again?",
